      "content": "but there is no support. everyone is part of the machine that keeps me here. it's like i'm living in a cage and the only way to actually stop being part of this is to stop existing altogether. i just keep thinking about how peaceful it would be if i could just... not be here. to finally have some actual silence and autonomy. do you think that's crazy? just wanting an escape that actually works?",
